---
---

<div class="kmb-banner">
  <div class="kmb-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧳</div>
  <div class="kmb-copy">
    <p class="kmb-eyebrow">Partner</p>
    <h2>Landing in Istanbul? Skip the luggage hassle.</h2>
    <p class="kmb-desc">
      Keepsmybag picks up your bags at IST or SAW and delivers them straight to your hotel —
      verified couriers, insured, tracked by QR code. You walk out of the airport hands-free.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="kmb-actions">
    <a class="btn" href="https://www.keepsmybag.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      Book with Keepsmybag →
    </a>
    <a class="kmb-link" href="/luggage-delivery">How it works</a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .kmb-banner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.8rem;
    background: var(--color-secondary-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-secondary);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.8rem 2rem;
  }
  .kmb-icon {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .kmb-eyebrow {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
  }
  .kmb-copy h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
  }
  .kmb-desc {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
  .kmb-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .kmb-link {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .kmb-banner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .kmb-actions {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
